---
title: Avgolemono Soup
description: Classic Greek chicken soup, comprising egg and lemon sauce
servings: 4
course: Main
source: https://www.theguardian.com/food/2024/mar/27/how-to-make-the-perfect-greek-avgolemono-soup-recipe-felicity-cloake
author: Felicity Cloake
image: https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/66177496f33303ee17bc2e967428af85ae4403b8/271_1311_2897_2897/master/2897.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none
